<title>CHINA: China First Pencil 96 net up 19.22 pct.</title>
<headline>China First Pencil 96 net up 19.22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	  241.751	    vs    196.588</p>
<p> Net profit	 57.253	    vs     48.023</p>
<p> Asset per share     2.06  yuan   vs    2.07  yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share  0.376 yuan   vs    0.347 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: China First Pencil Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: the results were released in a company statement. All figures are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed a cash dividend of 0.16 yuan per share for all shareholders, pending approval of a shareholders' meeting.</p>
</text>
